# Production build config for the static web client.
# Vite auto-loads this file for `npm run build` (mode=production) and inlines
# VITE_* vars into the bundle (baked in at build time, not read at runtime).
#
# Default (this file as-is): VITE_API_BASE is UNSET => the bundle calls the API
# at the SAME ORIGIN. This is correct when the backend serves the built dist/
# at "/" (the one-process deployment).
#
# SEPARATE HOSTING: if the static site is hosted on a different origin than the
# API, uncomment and set this to the backend's public origin, then rebuild:
# VITE_API_BASE=https://api.your-domain.com
#
# Firebase web config is baked into src/firebase.ts (public, not secret); to
# point at a different Firebase project, set VITE_FIREBASE_* here.
